OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FThe Government vowed to formally
OL,8,Fregulate the funeral sector as
OL,9,Fgrieving families criticised the 20-
OL,10,Fyear prison sentence handed to crooked
OL,11,Ffuneral director Robert Bush.
OL,13,FBush, 48, breached his customers'
OL,14,Ftrust "on an industrial scale" for 12
OL,15,Fyears by hoarding bodies for months,
OL,16,Fgiving relatives the wrong ashes,
OL,17,Fselling fake funeral plans and
OL,18,Fstealing charity donations collected
OL,19,Fat his services.
OL,26,@vD@GOUvD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FOn Friday he was jailed for two
OL,8,Fdecades by a judge who said he had
OL,9,F"never known offences affect so many
OL,10,Fpeople so deeply".
OL,12,FMany of the family members who packed
OL,13,Fthe public gallery in court said the
OL,14,Fsentence was not long enough, with one
OL,15,Fsaying it was "atrocious".
OL,17,FJoanne Moody, whose father Peter Moody
OL,18,Fwas one of 31 bodies found at Legacy,
OL,19,Fsaid: "It's a joke, he's going to be
OL,20,Fout in 10 years.
OL,26,@qD@AOUrD@QO]wD@OOUwD@YO]{D@GOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,F"There's no justice for any of
OL,8,Fus...we're not going to get closure."
OL,10,FMichaela Baldwin, whose stepfather
OL,11,FDanny Middleton's body was also found
OL,12,Fat the site, said he should have got
OL,13,F"at least 30 years ` one for each
OL,14,Fbody".
OL,16,FAfter the sentencing on Friday, the
OL,17,FDepartment of Health and Social Care
OL,18,Fsaid it would formally regulate the
OL,19,Fsector "following the harrowing case
OL,20,Fin Hull".
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@eO]uD@AOUvD@EO]{D@HOU|D@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FHealth and Social Care Secretary
OL,8,FYvette Cooper said: "In the wake of
OL,9,Fthis horrific case, we will now bring
OL,10,Fforward comprehensive proposals to
OL,11,Fensure respect and dignity for the
OL,12,Fdeceased in every setting, including
OL,13,Fproper regulation of the funeral
OL,14,Fsector."
OL,16,FAs he sentenced Bush for 67 offences,
OL,17,Fincluding 30 counts of preventing a
OL,18,Flawful burial, Mr Justice Hillard said
OL,19,Fthe prison term could not "put right
OL,20,Fthe harm the defendant has done".
OL,26,@pD@UOUvD@HO]{D@[OU|D@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FThe judge said that no one who had
OL,8,Fever used Legacy could ever be sure
OL,9,Fthat they had received the right
OL,10,Fashes, causing "anguish and pain on a
OL,11,Fscale beyond comprehension".
OL,13,FHe went on to say Bush was "so
OL,14,Fpreoccupied with his own enrichment
OL,15,Fthat he behaved in a shocking and
OL,16,Fdisgraceful way towards the deceased
OL,17,Fentrusted to his care, and his
OL,18,Fbehaviour towards their living
OL,19,Frelatives was characterised by
OL,20,Fdishonesty, deception and
OL,21,Fheartlessness".
OL,26,@rD@POUsD@[O]uD@\OU}D@NO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FThe judge said: "If he could re-use a
OL,8,Fcoffin someone had already paid for,
OL,9,Fhe would do so.
OL,11,F"If it was cheaper to keep someone in
OL,12,Fnon-refrigerated conditions, he would
OL,13,Fdo that too."
OL,26,@oD@QOUsD@AOUuD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FSpeaking of the families who received
OL,8,Fthe wrong ashes, or none, the judge
OL,9,Fsaid: "How betrayed they feel `
OL,10,Fhusbands and wives, partners, parents,
OL,11,Fchildren, grandchildren ` now
OL,12,Fdiscovering they are left with nothing
OL,13,For, in some cases we heard, an empty
OL,14,Fplastic bag or a teaspoonful of ashes
OL,15,Fthe police managed to recover."
OL,17,FOver four days, Bush, 48, looked
OL,18,Femotionless in the dock as statements
OL,19,Ffrom more than 200 victims were read
OL,20,Fin court, with many who chose to read
OL,21,Fthem in person breaking down in tears.
OL,26,@qD@GOUwD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FOne woman who was given the wrong
OL,8,Fashes for her husband told the
OL,9,Fdefendant he had fooled people in Hull
OL,10,Fwith his mild manner, when in fact he
OL,11,Fwas a "cruel conman who used people's
OL,12,Fgrief to fund his lifestyle".
OL,14,FThe court heard Bush's offending came
OL,15,Fto light in March 2024 when he was on
OL,16,Fholiday with his daughter in Arizona
OL,17,Fand asked two directors of another
OL,18,Ffuneral firm to help with a body
OL,19,Frecovery while he was away.
OL,26,@sD@GOUtD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FA casual worker at Legacy told the two
OL,8,Fmen "out of the blue" that bodies had
OL,9,Fbeen at the site "for years".
OL,11,FPolice were called and searched the
OL,12,Fsite, uncovering a "shocking" scene
OL,13,Fwhere decomposing bodies had been left
OL,14,Fon the racks of a cold storage area,
OL,15,Fwith the remains of a foetus contained
OL,16,Fin a paper bag on the floor.
OL,26,@pD@EOUpD@UO]qD@ROUqD@\O]tD@TOUtD@]O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FThe court heard the rest of the site
OL,8,Fwas in a "lamentable state", with
OL,9,Fashes kept in mouldy boxes and even
OL,10,Fstrewn across the floor, photographs
OL,11,Fleft out of coffins and jewellery not
OL,12,Freturned to families.
OL,14,FThe investigation found that 31
OL,15,Fbodies, including that of unborn baby
OL,16,FSunny Beverley-Conlin, should have
OL,17,Fbeen cremated months earlier, and most
OL,18,Fof their families had already been
OL,19,Fgiven ashes.
OL,26,@pD@JOUpD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31611
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FRelatives of people whose bodies were
OL,8,Fdiscovered described their disgust at
OL,9,Flearning what had happened, with one
OL,10,Fdaughter saying the image reminded her
OL,11,Fof Auschwitz.
OL,13,FOfficers were able to identify another
OL,14,F57 families who had either been given
OL,15,Fthe wrong ashes or no ashes, but the
OL,16,Fcourt heard there was also a large
OL,17,Fquantity of unlabelled ashes at the
OL,18,Fsite, and no one who used Legacy
OL,19,Fduring that time could ever know for
OL,20,Fsure if they had the right ones.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31612
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FThe details behind Bush's widespread
OL,8,Fpractice of giving out the wrong ashes
OL,9,Fare still largely unknown, and he
OL,10,Frefused to answer questions about it
OL,11,Fwhen asked by police.
OL,13,FDetective Superintendent Al Curtis
OL,14,Fsaid there was evidence that he was
OL,15,Fmixing up ashes and using a communal
OL,16,Fstore to give out to families when
OL,17,Fthey asked for their loved ones back.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31613
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FThe court heard of several cases when
OL,8,FBush gave a client the wrong ashes,
OL,9,Fbut collected the right ones from the
OL,10,Fcrematorium as little as two days
OL,11,Flater.
OL,13,FIn his police interviews he said:
OL,14,F"I've never given ashes back that
OL,15,Fweren't ashes", but refused to go into
OL,16,Fany further detail.
OL,26,@vD@AOUwD@NO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31614
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FHe also said that all the ashes were
OL,8,Fhuman, although an urn given to Lucy
OL,9,FNess ` one of four women given the
OL,10,Fwrong ashes for their unborn babies by
OL,11,FBush ` was found to contain what are
OL,12,Fthought to be animal remains.
OL,14,FIn one police interview, Bush said he
OL,15,Fhad developed a cash flow problem
OL,16,Fbecause "people did not always pay"
OL,17,Fand had debts of around #90,000.
OL,26,@xD@IOUxD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31615
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FHe said his plan had been to generate
OL,8,Fmore business and clear the backlog
OL,9,Fwithin two to three months, but had
OL,10,Fnever managed to "catch up".
OL,12,FDespite his debts, the court heard
OL,13,Fthat Bush was "profligate" in his
OL,14,Fpersonal spending, and over seven
OL,15,Fyears, while he was defrauding
OL,16,Fcustomers, he spent #42,000 on
OL,17,Fholidays and #21,000 on motorcycle
OL,18,Fracing.
OL,26,@rD@ROUrD@[O]uD@OOUuD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31616
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FThe court heard that many of his
OL,8,Fcustomers were on limited budgets,
OL,9,Fwith one woman describing how she had
OL,10,Fpaid for her mother's funeral partly
OL,11,Fthrough an online fundraising page.
OL,13,FBush often appeared to be helpful
OL,14,Ftowards people looking for more
OL,15,Faffordable options, offering discounts
OL,16,Fand telling them it would be cheaper
OL,17,Fto use his on-site chapel.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31617
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FBrooke Atkinson, who had been
OL,8,Festranged from her father before he
OL,9,Fdied, said Bush "could sense they
OL,10,Fhadn't arranged a funeral" and accused
OL,11,Fhim of "picking the most vulnerable of
OL,12,Fsociety".
OL,14,FThe court also heard from some of the
OL,15,F226 pensioners who said they had been
OL,16,F"conned" out of what little savings
OL,17,Fthey had after being sold fake funeral
OL,18,Fplans by Bush.
OL,26,@qD@QOUrD@ZO]sD@HOUtD@HO]xD@AOUxD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31618
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785656874
OL,3,CVictims call Robert Bush jail term
OL,4,C'atrocious' as Government vows
OL,5,Cregulation
OL,7,FHe pleaded guilty to 30 counts of
OL,8,Fpreventing a lawful and decent burial
OL,9,Fand 30 counts of fraud by false
OL,10,Frepresentation relating to bodies
OL,11,Ffound at the site, four "foetus
OL,12,Fallegations" of fraud, where he
OL,13,Fpresented ashes to women falsely
OL,14,Fsaying that they were "the remains of
OL,15,Ftheir unborn", a further charge of
OL,16,Ffraud covering the ashes of 57 people
OL,17,Fbetween 2017 and 2024, fraudulent
OL,18,Ftrading relating to funeral plans
OL,19,Fbetween 2012 and 2024 and theft from
OL,20,F12 charities.
OL,26,@sD@YOUtD@LO]vD@WOUwD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
